[Licensee/Applicant] restricts access to any security information on mobile computing and communications devices with information storage capability (e.g., notebook computers, personal digital assistants, cellular telephones) to authorized individuals only.[Licensee/Applicant] employs automated mechanisms to restrict access to media storage areas and audits access attempts and accesses granted.', N'CDA media includes both digital media (e.g., diskettes, magnetic tapes, external or removable hard drives, flash/thumb drives, compact disks, and digital video disks) and non-digital media (e.g., paper, microfilm).', N'Media Protection', N'System Protection', 3, NULL, N'Nrc_571', NULL, NULL, 2862, 50, NULL, NULL)
