y by the end of the next calendar day following the date that the Responsible Entity determines that the individual no longer requires retention of that access.  </Run></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="0.67,0.67,0.67,0.67" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="16" Margin="0.07,0,0,10.4"><Span><Run>An example of evidence may include, but is not limited to, documentation of all of the following: </Run></Span></Paragraph><List MarkerStyle="Decimal" Margin="0,0,0,0" Padding="0,0,0,0"><ListItem Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,2.33"><Span><Run>Dated workflow or sign-off form showing a review of logical and physical access; and   </Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>Logs or other demonstration showing such persons no longer have access that the </Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List><Paragraph TextAlignment="Justify" FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="16" Margin="48.07,0,2.07,0"><Span><Run>Responsible Entity determines is not necessary.   </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow></TableRowGroup></Table><Paragraph TextAlignment="Justify" FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run> 	 </Run></Span></Paragraph><Paragraph TextAlignment="Justify" FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Table CellSpacing="0" Margin="0.4,0,0,0"><Table.Columns><TableColumn Width="52.47" /><TableColumn Width="265.33" /><TableColumn Width="273.13" /><TableColumn Width="273.07" /></Table.Columns><TableRowGroup><TableRow><TableCell Padding="0.67,0.67,0.67,0.67" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000" Background="#FF204C81"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell ColumnSpan="2" Padding="0.67,0.67,0.67,0.67" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush=