 FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>EACMS;  </Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>PACS; and  </Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.07,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>PCA </Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,0"><Span><Run> </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="0.67,0.67,0.67,0.67" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,0"><Span><Run>Log events at the BES Cyber System level (per BES Cyber System capability) or at the Cyber Asset level (per Cyber Asset capability) for identification of, and after the fact investigations of, Cyber Security Incidents that includes, as a minimum, each of the following types of events:  </Run></Span></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="4.87,0,0,0"><Span><Run>4.1.1.</Run></Span><Span FontFamily="Arial"><Run> </Run></Span><Span><Run>Detected successful login attempts; </Run></Span></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="4.87,0,0.93,0"><Span><Run>4.1.2.</Run></Span><Span FontFamily="Arial"><Run> </Run></Span><Span><Run>Detected failed access attempts and failed login attempts; </Run></Span></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="4.87,0,0.93,0"><Span><Run>4.1.3.</Run></Span><Span FontFamily="Arial"><Run> </Run></Span><Span><Run>Detected malicious code. </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="0.67,0.67,0.67,0.67" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,2.27,6.53"><Span><Run>Examples of 