a. Configures the information system to provide only essential capabilities; andb. Prohibits or restricts the use of the following functions, ports, protocols, and/or services: [Assignment: organization-defined prohibited or restricted functions, ports, protocols, and/or services].', N'Supplemental ICT SCRM Guidance: Least functionality reduces the attack surface of ICT supply chain risks. Organizations should select components that allow the flexibility and option for specifying and implementing least functionality.TIER: 3', N'Configuration Management', N'Least Functionality', 4, NULL, N'C800_161', NULL, NULL, 557, 10, NULL, NULL)
