a. Compromises (both information system and supply chain);b. Changes or updates to roadmaps, new component development, updates to components, end-of-life decisions;c. The addition, replacement, and removal of system integrator personnel supporting organizational information system and supply chain infrastructure efforts; andd. Infrastructure changes within external service providers such as any new operating system rollout, hardware upgrades, or replacements due to field failures, or data store architecture shifts.TIER: 2, 3', N'System and Services Acquisition', N'Supply Chain Protection', 4, NULL, N'C800_161', NULL, NULL, 684, 48, NULL, NULL)
