The organization conducting the inspection/assessment obtains and examines the documented list of authorized users for a sampling of information system accounts to ensure that the authorized users are specified.CCI DefinitionThe organization being inspected/assessed documents authorized users of the information system.NIST 800-53 reference AC-2 (d)', N'Access Control', N'Access Control', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)
The organization conducting the inspection/assessment obtains and examines the documented list of authorized groups for a sampling of information system accounts to ensure that the authorized groups are specified.CCI DefinitionThe organization being inspected/assessed documents authorized group membership on the information system.NIST 800-53 reference AC-2 (d)', N'Access Control', N'Access Control', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)
The organization conducting the inspection/assessment obtains and examines the documented list of authorized roles for a sampling of information system accounts to ensure that the authorized roles are specifiedCCI DefinitionThe organization being inspected/assessed documents authorized role membership on the information system.NIST 800-53 reference AC-2 (d)', N'Access Control', N'Access Control', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)
The organization conducting the inspection/assessment obtains and examines the documented list of access authorizations for a sampling of information system accounts to ensure that the access authorizations are specified.CCI DefinitionThe organization being inspected/assessed documents  access authorizations (i.e., privileges) for each account on the information system.NIST 800-53 reference AC-2 (d)', N'Access Control', N'Access Control', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)
The organization conducting the inspection/assessment obtains and examines the documented list of other attributes for a sampling of information system accounts to ensure that other attributes are specified.CCI DefinitionThe organization being inspected/assessed documents other attributes for each account on the information system.NIST 800-53 reference AC-2 (d)', N'Access Control', N'Access Control', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)
The organization being inspected/assessed is automatically compliant with this CCI because they are covered at the DoD level. DoD has defined the personnel or roles as the ISSM or ISSO.CCI DefinitionDoD has defined the personnel or roles as the ISSM or ISSO.NIST 800-53 reference AC-2 (e )', N'Access Control', N'Access Control', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)
