The organization being inspected/assessed is automatically compliant with this CCI because they are covered at the DoD level. DoD has defined the frequency as annually.CCI DefinitionDoD has defined the frequency as annually.NIST 800-53 reference CP-1 (b) (2)', N'Contingency Planning', N'Contingency Planning', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 64, NULL, NULL)
