The organization conducting the inspection/assessment obtains and examines the contingency plan and audit trail to ensure the organization clearly and accurately updates the contingency plan to address organizational changes.CCI DefinitionThe organization being inspected/assessed must clearly and accurately update the contingency plan to address organizational changes. The organization must document the update activities as an audit trail.NIST 800-53 reference CP-2 (e)', N'Contingency Planning', N'Contingency Planning', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 64, NULL, NULL)
