NO, Combatant Command).Contractors who are also foreign nationals are identified as both, e.g., john.smith.ctr.uk@army.mil.  DoD has defined the characteristics as contractor or government employee and by nationality. User identifiers will follow the same format as DoD user e-mail addresses (john.smith.ctr@army.mil or john.smith.uk@army.mil); - DoD user e-mail display names (e.g., John Smith, Contractor <john.smith.ctr@army.mil> or John Smith, United Kingdom <john.smith.uk@army.mil>);  and - automated signature blocks (e.g., John Smith, Contractor,  J-6K, Joint Staff or John Doe, Australia, LNO, Combatant Command).Contractors who are also foreign nationals are identified as both, e.g., john.smith.ctr.uk@army.mil. NIST 800-53 reference IA-4 (4)', N'Identification And Authentication', N'Identification And Authentication', 0, NULL, N'CCI_V2', NULL, NULL, NULL, 65, NULL, NULL)
