 FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,2.47"><Span><Run>PACS; and</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem><ListItem Margin="48.13,0,0,0"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,0"><Span><Run>PCA</Run></Span></Paragraph></ListItem></List></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,7.67,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,0"><Span FontFamily="Calibri"><Run>For those methods identified in Part 3.1 that use signatures or patterns, have a process for the update of the signatures or patterns. The process must address testing and installing the signatures or patterns.</Run></Span><Span FontFamily="Calibri" FontWeight="Bold"><Run> </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell><TableCell Padding="7.13,7.47,7.67,0" BorderThickness="1,1,1,1" BorderBrush="#FF000000"><Paragraph FontFamily="Calibri" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0.07,0,0,0"><Span><Run>An example of evidence may include, but is not limited to, documentation showing the process used for the update of signatures or patterns. </Run></Span></Paragraph></TableCell></TableRow></TableRowGroup></Table><Paragraph FontFamily="Times New Roman" FontSize="14.666666666666666" Margin="0,0,0,10.67"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph><Paragraph FontFamily="Georgia" FontSize="16" Margin="0,0,0,0"></Paragraph></Section></FlowDocument>', N'System Security Management', N'Malicious Code Prevention', 0, NULL, N'NERC_CIP_R6', NULL, NULL, 8547, 25, NULL, NULL)
