and approves the institution’s cybersecurity program.', N'The financial institution’s risk, complexity, and available resources often dictate the degree to which they separate cybersecurity processes and controls from traditional practices defined by the information security program. Many institutions will not separately implement a cybersecurity program. In this case, evaluate the quality of information security policy, procedures and standards in terms of their contribution to managing cybersecurity risks.', N'Governance', N'Oversight', 0, NULL, N'ACET_V1', NULL, NULL, 16, 24, N'Review the Annual Report to the Board of Directors (or delegated board committee) meeting minutes where the Cybersecurity Program was reviewed and approved.

