Operators should develop and implement both baseline and enhanced security measures at each of their critical facilities.', N'Table 1 identifies the baseline and enhanced security measures for operators to implement at appropriate pipeline facilities. Recurring actions are summarized in Appendix A.', N'Facility Security Measures', N'Baseline and Enhanced Security Measures', NULL, NULL, N'TSA2018', NULL, NULL, 108, 33, NULL, NULL)
