nt appropriate compensating security controls (e.g., administrative controls).</td>		<td>Employ mechanisms to support the management of accounts.</td>	</tr>	</tbody></table><!--Table on Page 19--><br>', N'Pipeline Cyber Asset Security Measures', N'Security Measures for Pipeline Cyber Assets', NULL, NULL, N'TSA2018', NULL, NULL, 72, 45, NULL, NULL)
