', N'<p><b>Remote Access | Managed Access Control Points</b></p>Route remote accesses through authorized and managed network access control points.<br><b>Discussion:</b>Organizations consider the Trusted Internet Connections (TIC) initiative [DHS TIC] requirements for external network connections since limiting the number of access control points for remote access reduces attack surfaces.', N'Access Control', N'Remote Access', NULL, NULL, N'WMATA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)

