', N'<p><b>Wireless Access</b></p>a. Establish configuration requirements, connection requirements, and implementation guidance for each type of wireless access; andb. Authorize each type of wireless access to the system prior to allowing such connections.<br><b>Discussion:</b>Wireless technologies include microwave, packet radio (ultra-high frequency or very high frequency), 802.11x, and Bluetooth. Wireless networks use authentication protocols that provide authenticator protection and mutual authentication.', N'Access Control', N'Wireless Access', NULL, NULL, N'WMATA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)

