', N'<p><b>Least Privilege | Network Access to Privileged Commands</b></p>Authorize network access to [Assignment: organization-defined privileged commands] only for [Assignment: organization-defined compelling operational needs] and document the rationale for such access in the security plan for the system.<br><b>Discussion:</b>Network access is any access across a network connection in lieu of local access (i.e., user being physically present at the device).', N'Access Control', N'Least Privilege', NULL, NULL, N'WMATA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL)

