OT Discussion: As part of the incident handling capability, the organization coordinates with external vendors, integrators, or suppliers as necessary to ensure that they have the capability to address events that are specific to embedded components and devices. <br>[NIST 800-82 Rev 3: Implementation Statement]<br>

