', N'<p><b>System Partitioning | Separate Physical Domains for Privileged Functions</b></p>Partition privileged functions into separate physical domains.<br><b>Discussion:</b>Privileged functions that operate in a single physical domain may represent a single point of failure if that domain becomes compromised or experiences a denial of service.', N'System and Communications Protection', N'System Partitioning', NULL, NULL, N'WMATA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 72, NULL, NULL)

