OT Discussion: Some OT systems support write-protection by implementing physical key switches or write-protect switches. Organizations define the systems for which write-protection will be enabled and develop a process for how to take the system out of write-protect mode. <br>[NIST 800-82 Rev 3: Implementation Statement]<br>


', NULL, N'System and Communications Protection', N'Hardware-Based Protection', NULL, NULL, N'WMATA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 72, NULL, NULL)
