', N'<p><b>Boundary Protection | Connections to Public Networks </b></p>Prohibit the direct connection of [Assignment: organization-defined system] to a public network.<br><b>Discussion:</b>A direct connection is a dedicated physical or virtual connection between two or more systems. A public network is a network accessible to the public, including the Internet and organizational extranets with public access.', N'System and Communications Protection', N'Boundary Protection', NULL, NULL, N'WMATA', NULL, NULL, NULL, 72, NULL, NULL)

